# ASB-001 — Admin surface bootstrap

**Authority:** EPH Track III · complements [platform-surface-cohesion.mdoc](./platform-surface-cohesion.mdoc) § 2b.

Admin (`apps/web`) resolves tenant context through the same guest-surface-host chain as marketing and portal, with operator session overlay.

## Contract

```text
resolveAdminBootstrapForWebHost(host)
  → resolveAdminBootstrapForHost (packages/guest-surface-host)
       ├─ resolveTenantIdFromDevHost(host, "admin")
       ├─ fetchPublicTenantContextForHost
       └─ dev allowed ? devFallbackTenantId() : throw ADMIN_TENANT_UNRESOLVED
```

## Implementation map

| Layer | Module |
| ----- | ------ |
| GSH | `packages/guest-surface-host/src/resolve-admin-surface-bootstrap.ts` |
| Web wrapper | `apps/web/src/tenant/resolve-admin-bootstrap.server.ts` |
| Layout kernel | `apps/web/src/tenant/tenant-kernel.server.ts` |
| Identity BFF | `apps/web/src/auth/identity-bff-headers.ts` |

## Forbidden

- Direct `fetchPublicTenantContextForHost` in web kernel with env fallback when API returns null (fail-soft).
- Duplicate tenant resolution logic outside GSH + thin web wrapper.

## Guards + specs

- `guard:surface-cohesion` — kernel + identity BFF import ASB wrapper.
- `apps/web/test/admin-bootstrap-parity.spec.ts`
- `apps/web/test/identity-bff-asb.spec.ts`
- `apps/web/test/session-host-binding-multilevel.spec.ts`

## Branding

Unchanged — `fetchPublicTenantBrandingForHost` on login/settings; bootstrap supplies `tenantId` + `pluginId` only.
